///   `0x801ac840` (the machine-check handler) prints this value as "HID2".
///
/// # Bits used by this image (observed)
/// - `0x2000_0000` - paired-single enable (`PSE`); `0x801a9d40` tests it before
///   touching the paired-single register halves.
