/// Releases one level of a mutex and wakes its waiters.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801b2f40` at `0x801b2f40` (200 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801b2f40_FUN_801b2f40.c`: masks
///   interrupts, decrements `+0x0c` only when the caller is the owner, and on
