/// Blocks on a condition variable, atomically releasing a mutex.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801b3150` at `0x801b3150` (220 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801b3150_FUN_801b3150.c`: takes the
