/// One-shot IOS initialisation: handlers, masks and the reset wait.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801b2d50` at `0x801b2d50` (204 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801b2d50_FUN_801b2d50.c`
///
/// # Arguments
