/// Stores one 6-word half of the `+0x9C` block into slot `index`.
///
/// Slots `0` and `1` are the two halves of the twelve words the constructor
/// fills: `+0x9C..+0xB0` and `+0xB4..+0xC8`. The body writes the six source
/// words and then reports event `9` with argument `1` on the object's own
/// vtable slot `+0x20`; with a null source it reports the same event with `0`
/// and writes nothing.
