/// `1` when the holder's removal call returned non-zero, `0` otherwise (also
/// `0` when no entry matches).
///
/// # Side effects
/// One two-argument virtual call on the holder.
///
/// # Safety
/// The array must be readable for `count` words and the vtable slot `+0x38`
/// must be callable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - the scan, the index computation and the `(-r | r) >> 31` fold are
/// literal; the slot's role is inferred as "remove by index", matching
/// [`fn_802585c0`] which is the body the slot most likely points at.
