/// prints, i.e. the table is a `0x30`-byte strided array based at `0x8038F890`
/// and each entry holds six words at `+0x00..+0x14`. A slot whose first word is
/// `-1` is skipped; otherwise `0x801BAFB0` is called with all six words and, on
/// success, the first word is set to `-1`.
