/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801bb1c0` at `0x801bb1c0` (140 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801bb1c0_FUN_801bb1c0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `param`: address-like key; only `(param - 0x8038F890) / 0x30` is used.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One six-argument call plus a `-1` store when it succeeds.
///
/// # Safety
/// The derived index must stay inside the table.
///
/// # Confidence
