/// literal. Two printed argument lists contradict the callees' own exports:
/// `0x801BE010` is printed with `(0x70007, 0x8070000)` but takes no parameters
/// of its own, so it is called with none here; `0x8024D4F0` takes none in its
/// own export but is printed with the table address, which is passed as printed
/// (`// unknown:` which of the two readings the linker actually used).
