/// Builds a twelve-word record with three fill words and forwards it.
///
/// Nine input words are copied to record slots `0, 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10`;
/// slots `3`, `7` and `11` receive the `sda2(-0x4A0C)` word. The record is then
/// handed to `0x801C9A80(record, arg, 0)`.
