/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8024a150` at `0x8024a150` (128 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8024a150_FUN_8024a150.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `source`: nine readable words.
/// - `arg`: second argument of the callee.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Fills a `0x30`-byte stack record and makes one call.
///
/// # Safety
/// `source` must be readable for `0x24` bytes.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - every slot assignment, the fill source and the call are literal.
