/// when the first register is non-null, the mode is stored at `sda(-0x49E0)`
/// and forwarded to `0x8024A3D0`. Mode `0`/`1` re-installs the second
/// callback; mode `2` registers eight `0x10`-byte slots starting at
/// `0x803DEE00` with ids `0xF0000 + i * 0x2000`, records the count at
/// `sda(-0x49DC)` and re-installs the callback again.
