/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8024bae0_FUN_8024bae0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `slot`: points at the controller record.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Up to five byte stores, up to five latch updates.
///
/// # Safety
/// `slot` must be readable; a null record disables every compare.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the five compares and both clear masks (`0xFFFFFFFC` for bytes 0..1,
/// `0xFFFFFFFE` for bytes 2..4) are literal. `// inferred:` byte 4 stays a byte
