/// Re-emits one record's vertex, colour and texture words into the GX FIFO.
///
/// The record's flag word selects which command groups are live: bits 0/1 gate
/// the `+0x04` word, bit 2 makes the packed colour word depend on a FIFO read,
/// bits 4/5 gate the two texture-enable words and the `0x803DEF41 == 2` test
/// gates a second block of `+0x14`-relative words. The four colour bytes are
/// `colors[i] * record[i + 8]` passed through the fixed-point bias pair from
/// `sda2(-0x49E8)`/`sda2(-0x49EC)`. Every texture word ORs `0xFFFF87C3` (mode 0)
/// or `0xFFFF87C1` (other modes) into the stored mask.
