/// `0x8024E180`, and finally the register-handoff entry `0x802DCDA8`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `tags` must be a terminated tag array and every resolved entry readable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - the walk, the guards and the key layout are literal; the two
/// table-lookup roles (`0x8023B2A0` visibility, `0x8023B950` drawable,
/// `0x8023B800` frame) are `// inferred:` from which field each result is read
/// through.
