///   (`r3`) and the holder (`r4`).
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the resolved ids into the header and calls `0x802DCDB4` with the
/// all-resolved flag.
///
/// # Safety
/// The holder and the relocated key table must be readable, and the written
/// error.
///
/// # Confidence
