/// Shared tail of the three power-down blocks in [`fn_801b3870`].
///
/// # Original
/// - Not an original function: the nine calls that every `OSHotReset` attempt
///   in `FUN_801b3870` makes before giving up (flush, disable the `0xE0`
///   channel, commit, and print both failure strings).
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `source`: the `"OSReset.c"` file string address.
/// - `hot_reset`: the hot-reset failure string.
/// - `menu`: the return-to-menu failure string.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
