/// ([`wake_all`]) and advances the three frame-deadline counters.
///
/// # Original
/// - Removed: the `_restgpr_26` epilogue call (`0x802DCDBC`).
///   The epilogue `bl` returns no value; the argument it was passed is the routine's `r3` return.
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801bbbd0` at `0x801bbbd0` (2060 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801bbbd0_FUN_801bbbd0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// None.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// The VI register file, the shadow table, about fifteen SDA words, one device
/// request per pending command bit and up to five callbacks.
///
/// # Safety
/// Only valid on target: this runs on the vertical-retrace interrupt, saves and
/// restores the interrupted context, and its wait loop has no host exit.
///
/// # Confidence
