/// Up to three virtual `+0x14` emissions, one `+0x10` list reset and a
/// `0x802DCDAC` handoff close.
///
/// # Safety
/// Target only: the instance, its descriptor records and the list object must
/// be live; several callees have arguments the export drops.
///
/// # Confidence
/// low - the channel walk, the three offset arms, the matrix normalisation and
/// the five-argument publish are literal, but `0x8023D1B0`, `0x8024D210`,
/// `0x8024D4D0`, `0x8024D140` and `0x8024D390` are printed without arguments
/// (`Type propagation algorithm not settling`), so their roles are
