/// cell: if a remaining child has that cell's `0x8000` bit clear the parent cell
/// is zeroed, otherwise it is filled with `0x8000`. When no remaining child owns
/// any cell, flag 4 is cleared through `0x80249C60(object, 4, 0)`.
