///   `0x80247A48`; the next body starts at `0x80247A50` (slot 15).
/// - Table: slot 14 (`0x8034E620`).
/// - Evidence: `work/wave273/c_dis.txt`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `object`: child container.
/// - `index`: child slot to detach.
