/// - Extent: `0x80245440..0x80245500` (192 bytes), frame `-0x20`,
///   `_savegpr_26` at `0x80245450`, `_restgpr_26` at `0x802454EC`, `bclr` at
///   `0x802454FC`; three zero words follow and the next body starts at
///   `0x80245500`.
/// - Table: slot 12 (`0x8034E3C8`), the slot the parent `AnmObjTexPatNode`
///   table leaves null.
/// - Evidence: `work/wave275/c_dis_all.txt`
