///   `1 << (task - 1)` (`slw`), tested with `and.` against `+0xCC`;
///   `addis r0,r4,0xffff` + `cmpli r0,1` isolates `0x10001`; the notify id is
///   `lis 0x1` + `addi 3` = `0x10003`.
/// - Evidence: `work/wave277/a_dis_e860.txt`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `object`: scene object (`+0xCC` flags, `+0x2888` attached subtree).
/// - `task`: `G3dProc` task id.
